## DEPLOYMENT

```bash
# Deploy all canisters
dfx deploy --all

# Or deploy specific canisters
dfx deploy parallax
dfx deploy enterprise_ingest
dfx deploy emergence_engine
dfx deploy external_uses
dfx deploy substrate_engine
dfx deploy model_orchestrator

# Boot the system
dfx canister call parallax boot
```

