## API EXAMPLES

```motoko
// Enterprise client registration
await Parallax.registerClient(500);  // Enterprise tier

// Data ingestion
let patternsFound = await Parallax.ingest(1000000);  // 1MB of data

// Pattern recognition
let strength = await Parallax.recognizePattern("market analysis");

// Check system status
let state = await Parallax.getState();
let alive = await Parallax.isAlive();
let emergence = await Parallax.getEmergence();

// Enterprise stats
let stats = await Parallax.getEnterpriseStats();
// { totalClients, enterpriseClients, totalIngests, patternsRecognized }
```

